<p>NOTE - 1996 results exclude a Q4 1996 write downs and costs of $58.3 million, or $1.05 per share, related to flooding in Guatemala and Honduras, unspecified steps taken to achieve further long-term reductions in the delivered product cost of bananas, and certain claims relating to European Union quota restructuring actions.</p>
